From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:32:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] gamelist: read and write rocknix gamelists in the system
 folder

With LegacyGamelistFileLocation on, a system whose folder is under ROMDirectory reads gamelist.xml only from its system folder and writes it there, as ROCKNIX does, and never uses the appdata gamelist. Systems outside ROMDirectory keep the appdata gamelist. The system folder file is written to gamelist.xml.tmp and renamed over gamelist.xml.
